# PART 6: ADD A REAL RESEARCH AND SOURCE-RETRIEVAL SYSTEM

Improve the breadth and reliability of information available to the assistant.

Use existing research and browsing integrations first. If the application has no search capability, introduce a suitable, maintained search integration only after examining provider requirements, costs and compatibility.

An optional provider such as Tavily may be evaluated for AI-oriented web search, subject to configured credentials and budget.

